      },
      "sourceText": "Choose one specialization from the following areas: Accounting (Required courses: ACC 310, ACC 311; Select two from: ACC 313, ACC 320, ACC 400, ACC 403, BUS 488); AI for Business Innovation (Required: BUS 375; Select three from: ACC 320, BUS 338, BUS 356, BUS 379, BUS 444); Finance (Required: BUS 355; Select three from: BUS 317, BUS 331, BUS 332, BUS 336, BUS 356, BUS 365, BUS 366 OR ECO 360, BUS 367, BUS 381, ECO 383, BUS 406, BUS 488); Marketing (Required: BUS 358, BUS 359, BUS 448; Select one from: BUS 302, BUS 334, BUS 357, BUS 362, BUS 363, BUS 378, BUS 395, BUS 449, BUS 488); Operations Management (Select four from: BUS 371, BUS 372, BUS 375, BUS 393, BUS 488)"
